Each row is one accepted paper, ordered by acceptance date. The bar is
time under review at each journal (coloured by outcome); earlier, rejecting journals are
shown by outcome but not named. The filled dot (●) is acceptance; then comes first online
(○, advance access) and the version of record in a journal issue (◉). For online-only
journals those two coincide as a single ◉, and the gap from ● to ◉ is production time. The
full interactive version lets you zoom to any window.
